1
00:00:51,320 --> 00:00:52,600
This one is the older sister.

2
00:00:52,600 --> 00:00:54,330
This one is the younger sister.

3
00:00:54,360 --> 00:00:55,020
Incorrect.

4
00:00:55,560 --> 00:00:56,360
This one is the older sister.

5
00:00:56,360 --> 00:00:57,360
This one is the younger sister.

6
00:00:57,360 --> 00:00:58,890
General, what do you think?

7
00:01:01,920 --> 00:01:03,680
Even Cui Hu cannot
tell them apart this time.

8
00:01:03,680 --> 00:01:04,680
This is a sure win.

9
00:01:07,480 --> 00:01:08,600
Two brides,

10
00:01:09,160 --> 00:01:10,890
and they look exactly the same.

11
00:01:15,960 --> 00:01:16,520
General,

12
00:01:16,880 --> 00:01:18,520
Ke'ying wants to marry in my place.

13
00:01:18,520 --> 00:01:19,780
But I still want to ask,

14
00:01:19,960 --> 00:01:21,480
can you keep her safe, General?

15
00:01:21,480 --> 00:01:23,640
As long as Ke'ying is willing to marry me,

16
00:01:23,640 --> 00:01:25,360
what's done is done.

17
00:01:25,800 --> 00:01:27,260
No one will dare say a word.

18
00:01:27,320 --> 00:01:29,520
I will explain it to His Majesty myself.

19
00:01:31,120 --> 00:01:32,180
You know, General,

20
00:01:32,479 --> 00:01:34,320
Ke'ying has always had feelings for you.

21
00:01:34,320 --> 00:01:35,479
But as her older sister,

22
00:01:35,479 --> 00:01:36,880
I must ask one more thing.

23
00:01:37,080 --> 00:01:39,240
Will you treat her
with true sincerity, General?

24
00:01:39,240 --> 00:01:40,720
If you only want to use her

25
00:01:40,800 --> 00:01:41,800
for your own gain,

26
00:01:42,840 --> 00:01:44,280
please be merciful

27
00:01:44,759 --> 00:01:46,360
and let my younger sister go.

28
00:01:48,960 --> 00:01:50,360
My words carry little weight,

29
00:01:50,360 --> 00:01:51,320
so naturally, I cannot sway

30
00:01:51,320 --> 00:01:52,180
your decision.

31
00:01:52,759 --> 00:01:53,920
But my father knows

32
00:01:54,360 --> 00:01:56,360
you plan to use this marriage

33
00:01:56,400 --> 00:01:57,920
to control the Duke's Estate.

34
00:01:57,920 --> 00:01:59,360
If I were the one married off,

35
00:01:59,360 --> 00:02:01,160
he naturally wouldn't say much.

36
00:02:01,320 --> 00:02:02,040
But Ke'ying

37
00:02:02,280 --> 00:02:03,610
is his most favored one.

38
00:02:05,440 --> 00:02:07,370
He will definitely not let this go.

39
00:02:13,000 --> 00:02:13,960
What are you guys talking about?

40
00:02:13,960 --> 00:02:15,090
You look so serious.

41
00:02:19,520 --> 00:02:20,840
I was telling your sister

42
00:02:20,840 --> 00:02:22,000
that from the very beginning,

43
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:23,060
you are the only one

44
00:02:23,440 --> 00:02:24,640
I truly want to marry.

45
00:02:25,400 --> 00:02:26,460
As for your sister,

46
00:02:26,840 --> 00:02:28,370
just let her and Chu Qingyun

47
00:02:29,240 --> 00:02:30,440
be together.

48
00:02:30,720 --> 00:02:32,800
Does this count
as a straightforward confession?

49
00:02:32,800 --> 00:02:33,840
He's serious.

50
00:02:37,079 --> 00:02:38,280
Mr. Chu, you're here.

51
00:02:38,600 --> 00:02:39,680
Then you can talk with Wan.

52
00:02:39,680 --> 00:02:40,810
We won't bother you.

53
00:02:40,880 --> 00:02:41,940
Let's go. Let's go.

54
00:02:47,240 --> 00:02:48,200
I heard Ning Yuanci

55
00:02:48,200 --> 00:02:50,320
asked the Emperor to marry Xue Keying.

56
00:02:50,320 --> 00:02:51,000
Is it true?

57
00:02:53,600 --> 00:02:54,520
And it seems

58
00:02:54,800 --> 00:02:55,800
they are in love

59
00:02:56,160 --> 00:02:56,960
with each.

60
00:02:58,640 --> 00:03:00,320
By the way, you came at the right time.

61
00:03:00,320 --> 00:03:01,850
I have something to ask you.

62
00:03:02,480 --> 00:03:03,400
I don't plan

63
00:03:03,400 --> 00:03:04,720
to restore my mother's painting

64
00:03:04,720 --> 00:03:05,980
of Nirvana of Phoenix.

65
00:03:07,040 --> 00:03:07,960
I want to ask you

66
00:03:08,160 --> 00:03:09,520
to copy a new one for me.

67
00:03:12,440 --> 00:03:14,120
With the engagement resolved,

68
00:03:14,120 --> 00:03:15,680
Xue Ruowan is a free woman.

69
00:03:16,240 --> 00:03:18,360
It's only a matter of time before
the male and female leads' relationship

70
00:03:18,360 --> 00:03:19,440
gets on track.

71
00:03:20,440 --> 00:03:21,400
What are you thinking about?

72
00:03:21,400 --> 00:03:22,400
You look so happy.

73
00:03:23,720 --> 00:03:24,579
I was wondering

74
00:03:24,600 --> 00:03:26,079
when Ruowan and Mr. Chu

75
00:03:26,280 --> 00:03:28,140
will finally fall for each other.

76
00:03:30,200 --> 00:03:31,800
Aren't you happy

77
00:03:33,000 --> 00:03:34,660
to become the General's wife?

78
00:03:34,800 --> 00:03:36,280
In the Duke's estate,

79
00:03:36,480 --> 00:03:37,880
I was the beloved

80
00:03:38,160 --> 00:03:39,620
and carefree Second Lady.

81
00:03:40,000 --> 00:03:41,360
Not to mention that marrying you

82
00:03:41,360 --> 00:03:42,960
comes with the risk of being beheaded,

83
00:03:42,960 --> 00:03:43,820
and I'll have to

84
00:03:43,840 --> 00:03:45,640
manage such a huge General's estate

85
00:03:45,640 --> 00:03:46,440
in the future.

86
00:03:46,600 --> 00:03:47,920
Plus, there are so many people out there

87
00:03:47,920 --> 00:03:49,050
who want to kill you.

88
00:03:49,120 --> 00:03:50,800
I'd be living in fear every day.

89
00:03:50,800 --> 00:03:51,840
Tell me,

90
00:03:52,120 --> 00:03:53,120
what exactly are the benefits

91
00:03:53,120 --> 00:03:54,720
of being the General's wife?

92
00:03:55,440 --> 00:03:56,440
I can promise you,

93
00:03:57,040 --> 00:03:58,360
that as long as you are by my side,

94
00:03:58,360 --> 00:03:59,240
I will never let you

95
00:03:59,240 --> 00:04:00,160
get hurt.

96
00:04:04,880 --> 00:04:05,610
What is this?

97
00:04:05,680 --> 00:04:08,340
A betrothal gift prepared
exclusively for you.

98
00:04:10,680 --> 00:04:12,040
Is this pure gold?

99
00:04:17,240 --> 00:04:18,279
I've gotten married

100
00:04:18,279 --> 00:04:20,000
no less than 10 times in costume dramas,

101
00:04:20,000 --> 00:04:21,839
and played a substitute bride five times.

102
00:04:21,839 --> 00:04:23,080
But this is the first time

103
00:04:23,080 --> 00:04:25,140
someone has proposed to me like this.

104
00:04:32,960 --> 00:04:33,820
You said before

105
00:04:34,520 --> 00:04:35,450
that kissing you

106
00:04:35,720 --> 00:04:37,250
requires your permission.

107
00:04:37,960 --> 00:04:38,440
So,

108
00:04:40,560 --> 00:04:41,490
are you willing?

109
00:04:42,200 --> 00:04:42,640
I...

110
00:04:43,840 --> 00:04:44,280
I...

111
00:04:47,120 --> 00:04:47,520
I a-

112
00:04:49,960 --> 00:04:50,560
I am...

113
00:05:26,840 --> 00:05:28,770
Aren't you afraid I'm lying to you?

114
00:05:28,920 --> 00:05:30,440
And I'll just stab you

115
00:05:31,080 --> 00:05:32,280
on our wedding night?

116
00:05:33,360 --> 00:05:34,690
Do you think I can't tell

117
00:05:35,000 --> 00:05:36,120
when you're acting

118
00:05:37,040 --> 00:05:38,170
and when you're not?

119
00:05:39,320 --> 00:05:41,120
You can insult my character,

120
00:05:41,360 --> 00:05:43,120
but you can't insult my acting skills.

121
00:05:43,120 --> 00:05:44,600
I have awards to prove it.

122
00:05:44,720 --> 00:05:45,450
Then tell me,

123
00:05:46,800 --> 00:05:48,320
am I being sincere

124
00:05:49,920 --> 00:05:50,960
or fake right now?

125
00:05:54,000 --> 00:05:55,400
You have so many secrets.

126
00:05:56,000 --> 00:05:56,930
How would I know?

127
00:06:01,920 --> 00:06:02,400
See?

128
00:06:02,800 --> 00:06:03,520
I was right.

129
00:06:04,080 --> 00:06:04,960
Are you hiding some

130
00:06:04,960 --> 00:06:06,220
unspeakable scandal?

131
00:06:09,680 --> 00:06:10,740
Do you want to know?

132
00:06:14,640 --> 00:06:15,440
I will tell you

133
00:06:16,120 --> 00:06:17,120
when you marry me.

134
00:06:21,280 --> 00:06:23,140
I will uncover it sooner or later.

135
00:06:30,120 --> 00:06:31,560
General, the poisonous herb
you asked me to investigate

136
00:06:31,560 --> 00:06:32,720
is indeed only found

137
00:06:33,040 --> 00:06:34,500
in the Northern Frontier.

138
00:06:40,880 --> 00:06:41,940
Just as I expected.

139
00:06:42,320 --> 00:06:44,720
You went to such great lengths
to ask His Majesty for this marriage

140
00:06:44,720 --> 00:06:46,360
just to get close to Xue Shiyan,

141
00:06:46,360 --> 00:06:47,120
to make it easier to find

142
00:06:47,120 --> 00:06:48,520
evidence of his treason.

143
00:06:48,520 --> 00:06:49,640
As for who you marry,

144
00:06:49,640 --> 00:06:50,840
isn't it all the same?

145
00:06:51,120 --> 00:06:52,720
Why defy the imperial decree

146
00:06:52,840 --> 00:06:53,560
and agree to

147
00:06:53,560 --> 00:06:55,560
Xue Keying's substitution scheme?

148
00:06:57,280 --> 00:06:59,680
Ever since I was engaged to Xue Ruowan,

149
00:07:00,360 --> 00:07:02,290
she has been repeatedly attacked.

150
00:07:02,440 --> 00:07:04,400
All signs point to framing me.

151
00:07:05,040 --> 00:07:06,120
Xue Shiyan would not hesitate to

152
00:07:06,120 --> 00:07:08,050
sacrifice his own daughter's life

153
00:07:08,200 --> 00:07:10,240
to clear his suspicion of treason.

154
00:07:11,560 --> 00:07:12,840
Such a ruthless man,

155
00:07:13,400 --> 00:07:14,260
I do not believe

156
00:07:14,520 --> 00:07:16,400
he would show mercy to Xue Keying.

157
00:07:16,720 --> 00:07:17,520
It is better to bring her

158
00:07:17,520 --> 00:07:18,520
to my side sooner.

159
00:07:18,720 --> 00:07:19,200
It is

160
00:07:19,840 --> 00:07:20,700
safer this way.

161
00:07:23,440 --> 00:07:25,480
In the Battle of Black Water River
five years ago,

162
00:07:25,480 --> 00:07:27,000
someone leaked military intelligence,

163
00:07:27,000 --> 00:07:29,240
causing the tragic deaths
of the old Marquis and his wife.

164
00:07:29,240 --> 00:07:30,320
So far, we have only found out

165
00:07:30,320 --> 00:07:31,560
that the secret signal

166
00:07:31,560 --> 00:07:32,680
used by the Northern spies

167
00:07:32,680 --> 00:07:33,560
is a deer totem.

168
00:07:34,840 --> 00:07:35,600
But this totem

169
00:07:35,600 --> 00:07:37,680
has never appeared in the Duke's estate.

170
00:07:37,680 --> 00:07:39,000
Could Xue Shiyan

171
00:07:39,720 --> 00:07:40,520
be colluding with foreign enemies

172
00:07:40,520 --> 00:07:41,380
in another way?

173
00:07:43,080 --> 00:07:44,440
Have you caught the man

174
00:07:45,159 --> 00:07:46,000
from the lantern festival?

175
00:07:46,000 --> 00:07:47,520
I have sent men to search for him,

176
00:07:47,520 --> 00:07:49,120
but he has not been found yet.

177
00:07:50,120 --> 00:07:51,320
You mentioned before

178
00:07:51,400 --> 00:07:52,130
that this man

179
00:07:53,120 --> 00:07:53,800
was carrying a

180
00:07:53,800 --> 00:07:55,440
highly suspicious bag.

181
00:07:56,280 --> 00:07:57,240
He hides so well,

182
00:07:57,640 --> 00:07:58,800
he is definitely not an ordinary person.

183
00:07:58,800 --> 00:07:59,800
Find him even if you

184
00:07:59,800 --> 00:08:01,400
have to dig three feet under.

185
00:08:26,000 --> 00:08:27,840
I've learned a bit from My Lady

186
00:08:27,840 --> 00:08:28,720
over the years.

187
00:08:29,480 --> 00:08:31,400
Though not as good as Mr. Chu,

188
00:08:32,520 --> 00:08:35,049
it shouldn't be worse
than the Second Lady's.

189
00:08:39,640 --> 00:08:40,760
My Lady will definitely like it

190
00:08:40,760 --> 00:08:41,880
when she sees it.

191
00:08:48,840 --> 00:08:49,560
Lan,

192
00:08:51,560 --> 00:08:52,080
Lan!

193
00:08:52,360 --> 00:08:52,960
Lan!

194
00:08:53,440 --> 00:08:54,440
Stop hitting her!

195
00:08:55,680 --> 00:08:56,800
What did she do wrong?

196
00:08:56,800 --> 00:08:57,600
Beat her!

197
00:08:57,880 --> 00:08:58,360
No!

198
00:09:00,160 --> 00:09:01,290
Father, I was wrong.

199
00:09:01,400 --> 00:09:02,400
It's all my fault.

200
00:09:02,400 --> 00:09:04,060
Please don't hit Lan anymore.

201
00:09:08,600 --> 00:09:09,600
Stop hitting her!

202
00:09:09,720 --> 00:09:10,200
Stop!

203
00:09:10,200 --> 00:09:11,760
Drag My Lady away.

204
00:09:12,920 --> 00:09:13,920
Keep beating her.

205
00:09:14,280 --> 00:09:14,760
Lan!

206
00:09:15,280 --> 00:09:16,010
Lan! My Lady!

207
00:09:16,200 --> 00:09:16,760
My Lady!

208
00:09:16,840 --> 00:09:17,570
My Lady, Lan,

209
00:09:17,760 --> 00:09:18,080
let's go.

210
00:09:18,080 --> 00:09:19,200
Keep beating her!

211
00:09:19,280 --> 00:09:20,000
Lan!

212
00:09:21,440 --> 00:09:22,770
Why are you hitting her?

213
00:09:24,320 --> 00:09:25,320
No, no!

214
00:09:26,640 --> 00:09:28,640
Why? Why on earth?

215
00:09:28,960 --> 00:09:31,080
She confessed to poisoning you,

216
00:09:31,840 --> 00:09:33,600
hiding my paintings,

217
00:09:34,400 --> 00:09:36,520
and stealing jewelry from the storehouse.

218
00:09:36,520 --> 00:09:37,640
Unforgivable.

219
00:09:37,680 --> 00:09:38,680
Impossible.

220
00:09:39,120 --> 00:09:40,520
Whether it is true or not,

221
00:09:40,720 --> 00:09:42,200
you can ask her yourself.

222
00:09:44,120 --> 00:09:44,920
My Lady,

223
00:09:45,240 --> 00:09:46,200
I am sorry.

224
00:09:47,160 --> 00:09:48,840
I did it all for your own good.

225
00:09:49,520 --> 00:09:50,960
But I didn't expect...

226
00:09:51,840 --> 00:09:52,560
Stop!

227
00:09:52,600 --> 00:09:54,260
Now you believe it, don't you?

228
00:09:54,560 --> 00:09:55,320
Beat her!

229
00:09:55,360 --> 00:09:56,160
Xiaolan!

230
00:09:56,280 --> 00:09:57,810
Beat her to death! Xiaolan!

231
00:09:58,200 --> 00:09:59,240
Stop!

232
00:09:59,800 --> 00:10:02,360
Get out of here alive.

233
00:10:02,360 --> 00:10:03,160
No!

234
00:10:03,760 --> 00:10:04,480
Stay alive.

235
00:10:06,320 --> 00:10:07,000
Stay alive.

236
00:10:10,080 --> 00:10:11,120
Xiaolan!

237
00:10:14,600 --> 00:10:15,680
Xiaolan!

238
00:10:31,200 --> 00:10:31,880
What bad luck.

239
00:10:31,880 --> 00:10:32,680
Take her away.

240
00:10:33,280 --> 00:10:33,740
Mother!

241
00:10:39,480 --> 00:10:40,210
They said...

242
00:10:40,760 --> 00:10:42,690
Lan was beaten to death last night.

243
00:10:42,960 --> 00:10:43,760
Is that true?

244
00:10:44,560 --> 00:10:45,120
Yes.

245
00:10:46,360 --> 00:10:47,120
We finally found

246
00:10:47,120 --> 00:10:48,920
the one who poisoned that loser.

247
00:10:48,920 --> 00:10:49,650
Our names are

248
00:10:49,800 --> 00:10:50,800
finally cleared.

249
00:10:51,280 --> 00:10:52,080
Are you saying

250
00:10:52,520 --> 00:10:53,720
Lan was the one

251
00:10:53,720 --> 00:10:54,680
who poisoned Xue Ruowan?

252
00:10:54,680 --> 00:10:55,880
How is that possible?

253
00:10:55,920 --> 00:10:57,080
Why wouldn't it be?

254
00:10:57,200 --> 00:10:58,040
She confessed it herself

255
00:10:58,040 --> 00:10:59,160
before she died.

256
00:10:59,400 --> 00:11:01,330
She even tried to frame you before.

257
00:11:02,000 --> 00:11:02,760
Now,

258
00:11:03,680 --> 00:11:05,610
she finally got what she deserved.

259
00:11:07,200 --> 00:11:08,330
Where is Xue Ruowan?

260
00:11:09,200 --> 00:11:10,530
I need to find Xue Ruowan

261
00:11:10,760 --> 00:11:11,840
and see how she is.

262
00:11:12,800 --> 00:11:13,360
Stop

263
00:11:13,880 --> 00:11:14,610
right there!

264
00:11:14,680 --> 00:11:15,560
Why are you stopping me?

265
00:11:15,560 --> 00:11:16,960
Keep a close eye on the Second Lady.
